<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:24px;background:#f4f5f7;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1a1a1a;">
<div style="max-width:520px;margin:0 auto;background:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;padding:28px;">
<p>Hello{{if .name}} {{.name}}{{end}},</p>
<p>We received a request to reset your password. Use the button below to choose a new one.</p>
<p><a href="{{.reset_url}}" style="display:inline-block;background:#1a56db;color:#ffffff;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;">Reset password</a></p>
<p>This link is valid for {{.expires_in_minutes}} minutes. If you did not request a reset, you can ignore this email.</p>
</div></body></html>
